One value from the vocabulary in `list`, in display order.

`active` is the blank value (`blank-value`): it stands for the empty field and is never stored, so the field is only ever filled on the few tiddlers that have left circulation — list the live ones with `[!has[lifecycle]]`. Independent of `maturity`.
